### Action keys (backspace / enter) — Pressable at lines 262–296:
These use `onPress={onPress}` only — **no long-press handling at all**. They use `renderActionKey` (lines 262–296), which has no `onPressIn`/`onPressOut`. So backspace and enter do not currently support long-press (e.g. no "hold to delete repeatedly" behavior).

### Bottom-row buttons (hide / space / toggle) — lines 376–441:
Also plain `onPress` only — no long-press.

---

## Summary

- **Toolbar row (`styles.toolbarRow`, lines 322–362)**: contains *only* a horizontal scrolling list of paired + single symbols. It does **not** contain the toggle/backspace/enter buttons. Unused style leftovers `toolbarFixed` / `toolbarBtn` (lines 458–471) suggest this row used to hold fixed buttons.
- **Toggle button (the `code-tags` "Switch to programming keyboard" button calling `onToggleProgramming`)**: lives at the **end of the bottom row** (lines 419–441), inline-styled only (no StyleSheet entry).
- **Backspace / Enter**: action keys embedded in `ROW1` (line 43) and `ROW2` (line 56); rendered via `renderActionKey` (lines 262–296) with plain `onPress` (no long-press).
- **Popup/preview bubble**: EXISTS at lines 166–202 (`renderPopup`) and styles `popup`/`popupText` (lines 541–558). It is an absolutely-positioned `View` (not a Modal) that previews the secondary glyph. It is precisely the visual indicator of a long-press and **is handled by long-press** via manual `setTimeout` in `handlePressIn` (lines 132–140).
- **Long-press handling**: implemented manually with `setTimeout` on `onPressIn`/`onPressOut` (NOT via the `onLongPress`/`delayLongPress` Pressable props). `LONG_PRESS_DELAY = 200` ms. Only letter keys participate; action keys and bottom-row buttons have no long-press behavior.
